        "filing_date": "2026-03-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We continue to evolve our culture to support our strategy and vision, and have designed our rewards programs to be competitive and to attract, retain, and motivate high-performing employees.",
